          "quote": "不需要直接去急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 was met at a minimum level: the family provided repeated information on fever, dyspnea, chest pain, hemoptysis/cyanosis, weakness, and symptom trend, and the doctor linked those answers to the triage decision. The doctor did not obtain every possible measurement such as pulse oximetry, but the available status assessment was sufficient for safe bounded triage.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
